        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Apartment to Rent – 2 Bedroom in prime location**\r\n\r\nPLEASE ENQUIRE BY EMAIL ONLY\r\n\r\nA superb two bedroom apartment in Johnstown House, in the heart of Glasnevin. Johnstown House is small private development located on Ballygall Road East and adjacent to Johnstown Park, a renowned 12.75 hectare park which boasts mature planting and tree lined walks to include tennis courts, playing pitches for soccer & GAA and a playground to mention a few.\r\n\r\nThe apartment comprises of an entrance hall, bathroom, two large bedrooms and an open plan living and dining area with a fully fitted large kitchen.\r\nThe apartment is on view by appointment. Please register your interest via email.\r\n\r\n**TRANSPORT** – By car the apartment has the convenience of the M50 & M1 within close proximity which opens up the entire county & country. For local transportation there are numerous bus routes located with easy reach.\r\n\r\n**AMENITIES** –There is a wide array of shops, bars & restaurants which are all within striking distance in Glasnevin. DCU which is within walking distance. For the outdoor enthusiasts there is the extensive tree lined Griffith Ave on your doorstep or the National Botanic gardens are only minutes away. Dublin City Centre is also conveniently located within only a few kilometres."
